{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":96174,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"041a6ae5373e0a7add8f20635b9102f5","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The reactions API: the action type for navigation should be... The error says expected 'BACK' | 'CLOSE' for one variant, and for NODE it complains \"Invalid enum value... received 'NODE'\". Wait — it says at one point: \"Invalid enum value. Expected 'BACK' | 'CLOSE', received 'NODE'\". So type must be... hmm, actually the schema expects `{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation, transition}` — but the error says invalid. Maybe `navigation` values differ and `type` should be... Let me look: the accepted forms include CONDITIONAL, {type:'BACK'|'CLOSE'}, URL, UPDATE_MEDIA_RUNTIME, SET_VARIABLE... Wait, there must be a NAVIGATE variant. Hmm the first error block: \"Expected [0].actions[0] to be one of the following\" — lists CONDITIONAL, then a nested list with type BACK|CLOSE, URL, UPDATE_MEDIA_RUNTIME x3, transition validations, SET_VARIABLE... \n\nInteresting — the variant with `transition` checks complains transition.type must be MOVE_IN etc. and \"Required value missing at transition.direction, matchLayers\" — this variant is \"NODE\"? No... it received transition object for the DISSOLVE one (the AFTER_TIMEOUT splash link). For the plain ON_CLICK with transition:null, \"Expected null, received object\" — no wait, that was for the splash one which had transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\"...}.\n\nActually maybe the correct action shape is `{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation, transition, ...}` but navigation must be one of: 'NAVIGATE' | 'SWAP' | 'OVERLAY' | 'SCROLL_TO' | 'CHANGE_TO'. And transition for NAVIGATE must be `{type:'MOVE_IN'...direction...}` or DISSOLVE type... The error says DISSOLVE invalid — expected MOVE_IN|MOVE_OUT|PUSH|SLIDE_IN|SLIDE_OUT. Hmm, but Figma does have DISSOLVE transitions... The plugin API typings: `transition: Transition | null` where Transition = {type:\"DISSOLVE\"|\"SMART_ANIMATE\"|\"SCROLL_ANIMATE\"|...}? Not sure. The validation error suggests transition.type must be one of MOVE_IN etc when it's an object of that variant. Maybe DISSOLVE requires `{type:\"DISSOLVE\", duration, easing, matchLayers}` and easing must be object `{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}` not string. The error: \"Expected object, received string at transition.easing\" — yes! easing must be an object. And DISSOLVE invalid enum... but it also says \"Expected null, received object\" for one variant — meaning for simple NAVIGATE, transition should be null.\n\nSo the first failure was on the splash AFTER_TIMEOUT reaction with DISSOLVE transition — easing as string failed and DISSOLVE wasn't accepted in that variant list (maybe because the variant requires direction for slide-type transitions, and DISSOLVE is in another variant... confusing).\n\nSimplest: use transition:null everywhere and correct easing format avoided. And check trigger format for AFTER_TIMEOUT: `{type:\"AFTER_TIMEOUT\", timeout:800}` — likely fine.\n\nAlso for OVERLAY navigation, actions may need `overlayPosition`? Optional probably. Let me retry with transition:null.\n\nAlso note the error occurred on line 9 — that's the link() helper? Actually line 9 is the splash reactions line? The order: link() defined, then splash reactions set directly with DISSOLVE transition — that threw. So subsequent links didn't run. Retry all with transition null.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14b42764-d761-4609-9d48-7eed784bda72","uuid":"56f8f27a-b523-44c0-ad23-a5faae6a751f","timestamp":"2026-10-31T00:33:29.741Z","thinking_duration_ms":24535}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":96174,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"041a6ae5373e0a7add8f20635b9102f5","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_49_301a4eb3","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"gy7Y1r5tsWp5YRcrXvqUCN","code":"const W = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"5:2\");\nconst scr = {}; for (const c of W.children) if (c.type===\"FRAME\") scr[c.name]=c;\nfunction findNode(f, name){ return f.findOne(n=>n.name===name); }\nasync function link(node, target, nav){\n  if (!node) return \"MISSING\";\n  node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}, actions:[{type:\"NODE\", destinationId:target.id, navigation:nav||\"NAVIGATE\", transition:null}]}];\n}\nscr[\"01_Splash\"].reactions=[{trigger:{type:\"AFTER_TIMEOUT\", timeout:800}, actions:[{type:\"NODE\", destinationId:scr[\"02_Onboarding_Choose_Products\"].id, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition:null}]}];\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"02_Onboarding_Choose_Products\"],\"NextBtn\"), scr[\"03_Onboarding_Make_Payment\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"02_Onboarding_Choose_Products\"],\"Skip\"), scr[\"05_Sign_In\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"03_Onboarding_Make_Payment\"],\"NextBtn\"), scr[\"04_Onboarding_Get_Your_Order\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"03_Onboarding_Make_Payment\"],\"Prev\"), scr[\"02_Onboarding_Choose_Products\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"03_Onboarding_Make_Payment\"],\"Skip\"), scr[\"05_Sign_In\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"04_Onboarding_Get_Your_Order\"],\"GetStartedBtn\"), scr[\"05_Sign_In\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"04_Onboarding_Get_Your_Order\"],\"Prev\"), scr[\"03_Onboarding_Make_Payment\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"04_Onboarding_Get_Your_Order\"],\"Skip\"), scr[\"05_Sign_In\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"05_Sign_In\"],\"LoginBtn\"), scr[\"08_Get_Started\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"05_Sign_In\"],\"ForgotPassword\"), scr[\"07_Forgot_Password\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"05_Sign_In\"],\"SignUpLink\"), scr[\"06_Sign_Up\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"06_Sign_Up\"],\"CreateAccountBtn\"), scr[\"08_Get_Started\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"06_Sign_Up\"],\"LoginLink\"), scr[\"05_Sign_In\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"07_Forgot_Password\"],\"SubmitBtn\"), scr[\"05_Sign_In\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"08_Get_Started\"],\"GetStartedBtn\"), scr[\"09_Home\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"09_Home\"],\"TrendingViewAll\"), scr[\"10_Product_List\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"09_Home\"],\"SponsoredCard\"), scr[\"11_Product_Detail\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"11_Product_Detail\"],\"BackBtn\"), scr[\"09_Home\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"11_Product_Detail\"],\"GoToCart\"), scr[\"12_Shopping_Bag\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"11_Product_Detail\"],\"CartEntry\"), scr[\"12_Shopping_Bag\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"12_Shopping_Bag\"],\"BackBtn\"), scr[\"11_Product_Detail\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"12_Shopping_Bag\"],\"ProceedToPayment\"), scr[\"13_Payment\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"13_Payment\"],\"BackBtn\"), scr[\"12_Shopping_Bag\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"13_Payment\"],\"ContinueBtn\"), scr[\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\"], \"OVERLAY\");\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\"],\"SuccessDialog\"), scr[\"09_Home\"]);\nawait link(findNode(scr[\"15_Profile\"],\"BackBtn\"), scr[\"09_Home\"]);\nfor (const fname of [\"09_Home\",\"10_Product_List\",\"11_Product_Detail\",\"13_Payment\",\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\"]){\n  const f=scr[fname];\n  const nav=f.children.find(c=>c.name===\"MainNav\");\n  if(!nav) continue;\n  const cart=nav.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Icon_Cart\");\n  const sett=nav.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Icon_Setting\");\n  const home=nav.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Icon_Home\");\n  if(cart) await link(cart, scr[\"12_Shopping_Bag\"]);\n  if(sett) await link(sett, scr[\"15_Profile\"]);\n  if(home && fname!==\"09_Home\") await link(home, scr[\"09_Home\"]);\n}\nreturn \"prototype wired\";","description":"Wire all prototype interactions (transition null)"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14b42764-d761-4609-9d48-7eed784bda72","uuid":"bf6f8d3e-29ce-46fc-83ad-cb9aa61cbb2c","timestamp":"2026-10-31T00:33:41.739Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_49_301a4eb3","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
