{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":118446,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"041e6ae53ca00a7a1d7b7c03f3e4e607","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reasoning summary: All 15 screens are built and verified via screenshots; the prototype is fully wired per the brief (onboarding chain, auth flow, purchase flow with the success overlay over Payment, and tab-bar navigation). One note: the 14_Payment_Success_Overlay frame's node ID changed from the original 12:15 to 24:80 after I replaced an accidentally-emptied frame with the correct clone (name and content are intact).\n\nFinal answer:\n\n**文件**: https://www.figma.com/design/gy7Y1r5tsWp5YRcrXvqUCN/\n**交付页面**: 03 · Workspace (page ID `5:2`)\n\n**15 个屏幕（375×812，浅模式，Montserrat，品牌色 #F83758)**:\n| 屏幕 | ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Splash | 12:2 |\n| 02_Onboarding_Choose_Products | 12:3 |\n| 03_Onboarding_Make_Payment | 12:4 |\n| 04_Onboarding_Get_Your_Order | 12:5 |\n| 05_Sign_In | 12:6 |\n| 06_Sign_Up | 12:7 |\n| 07_Forgot_Password | 12:8 |\n| 08_Get_Started | 12:9 |\n| 09_Home （滚动， 2116h) | 12:10 |\n| 10_Product_List (14 商品） | 12:11 |\n| 11_Product_Detail | 12:12 |\n| 12_Shopping_Bag | 12:13 |\n| 13_Payment | 12:14 |\n| 14_Payment_Success_Overlay | 24:80 |\n| 15_Profile | 12:16 |\n\n另建有 `MainNav` 组件 (16:2)；复用了给定的 Button、Text Field、Status Bar、Home Indicator 组件和 04·Media 全部素材（缺图商品用统一\"No photo\"占位）。\n\n**原型连线（已完成）**:\n- 01 自动前进 → 02;Next/Prev 链 02→03→04;Skip 直达 05\n- 05 Login → 08;Forgot → 07 → Submit → 05;Sign Up ↔ 06;06 Create Account → 08 → Get Started → 09\n- 09:Trending View all → 10、Sponsored → 11、avatar → 15\n- 11:back → 09、Go to cart/cart icon → 12\n- 12:back → 11、Proceed to Payment → 13\n- 13:back → 12、Continue → 14 (OVERLAY,Payment 保留在下方）\n- 14：点按 dialog → 09\n- 底部导航（09/10/11/13/14):Cart → 12、Setting → 15、Home → 09；当前 tab 高亮（13/14